  "details": "The platform is in desperate need of a word filter list on things like Avatars, Groups and Worlds. You can use basically any slur, swear, sexual or inappropriate word without consequence. You can also put malicious links and straight up porn sites in your bio without any consequence.\n\nThis filter could be set on a user by user bases based on age and settings with the worst slurs and words being blocked outright but VRChat is a 13+ game and needs more basic safety features like this one. This filter should also be expanded to cover special characters that are commonly used.\n\nPlease consider adding this much needed moderation step.",
